\title{Repeating a rotation at one label}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{A coordinate change fixing a [momentum label](fdip-0164)
can still move a vector in its translation block. Repeating
a quarter-turn returns its components after #{4} steps.
Which scalar multipliers can appear during one step, and what
happens when another operator moves a vector from one multiplier
to the next?}
